id: mental-warfare
name: Mental Warfare
talentCategory: taunt
prerequisites: Personality Score of 4+
description: >
  You are not above breaking a target’s spirit to win a fight.
text: >
  Mental Warfare: You are not above breaking a target’s spirit to win a fight.
  –Prerequisites: Personality Score of 4+
  (1)-[Passive]: Gain access to the Insult Special Maneuver.
  (2)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If an Opponent is knocked through a Health Threshold by an Attacking Maneuver, you may use the Insult Maneuver (targeting that Opponent) as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver.

---

[passive]
# (1)
allow maneuver.insult;

# (2) An Opponent knocked through a Health Threshold by anybody's Attacking Maneuver - yours, an Ally's (the `opponent-knocked`
# Moment): the Insult out of sequence at them, offered on your latest card - never Automatic, it hands over an Out-of-Sequence
# Maneuver; the Insult's own 1/Round still its (chat.mjs mentalWarfare).
[triggered/opponent-knocked, 1/round, outOfSequence, effect 2]
requires knockedOpponent;
mentalWarfare();
